/data/

# The pre-existing UI mockup is now TRACKED, so the look can be ported from a
# clone on any machine. It is pre-existing work and `6-ship` still has to
# disclose it in the README — being in the repo makes that obligation more
# visible, not less. See checklist.md > Revisions.

# Safety net: generated art anywhere. Scoped so the hand-made logo
# files in /assets stay tracked.
/public/chapter/
/public/generated/
*.generated.png
*.generated.webp

